# Aetheria — files excluded from `docker build` context.
# Keeps image small and prevents accidental leakage of dev artefacts.

# Dependencies — installed inside the container
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build artefacts — rebuilt inside the container
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Prisma clients — regenerated in the build stage
**/src/generated
**/.prisma

# Secrets — never bake into an image
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# IDE / OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Test artefacts
coverage
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
playwright-report
test-results

# Docs / planning
docs
buglist
memory
schedule
*.md
!README.md

# Claude / scratch
.claude
SECURITY_PATCHES.md

# Local SQLite files (legacy — kept for safety in case any linger)
.dev
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local logs
*.log
